    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present this deceptively spacious three bedroom semi-detached townhouse to the market. Ideally positioned on this quiet residential cul-de-sac off Castlewood Avenue, 1 Castlewood Lodge is complemented by a south facing rear garden, ample off street parking to the front and attic room. \n\nExtending to 104 sq.m. /1,125 sq.ft. approx. (with a further 20 sq.m / 215 sq ft in the attic rooms) the property has been lovingly maintained, upgraded and extended by the current owners and boasts light-filled and well-proportioned accommodation with ample storage. At hall level there is a spacious double bedroom, guest w.c., living / dining room which connects through to the extended open plan kitchen/dining/living room, leading to the sunny south-facing rear garden. Upstairs there are two fine double bedrooms and well-appointed bathroom. The second floor comprises an attic room with walk-in wardrobe. \n\nTucked away off Castlewood Terrace the location is so convenient with most social and essential amenities within a gentle stroll from the doorstep in Rathmines Town and Ranelagh village. A mere 4 kilometres from St. Stephen's Green with some of Dublin's best schools, sports clubs, wonderful restaurants, shops and transport facilities on your doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.45m x 1.2m\nHardwood engineered oak floor, wall panelling, ceiling coving, centre rose.\n\nLiving Room - 4.60m x 3.55m\nHardwood engineered oak floor, under stair storage cupboard, recessed lighting\n\nKitchen/Dining room - 6.50m x 3.55m\nHardwood oak floor, kitchen wall and floor units handcrafted birch ply, Quartz countertop, skylight, gas hob, Belfast sink, tiled splashback, sliding door to south facing rear garden.\n\nPlayroom / Bedroom 3 - 3.90m x 2.25m\nHardwood engineered oak floor, window to front, storage cupboard.\n\nGuest WC - 1.35m x 1.30m\nTiled floor, wash hand basin, WC, extractor fan.\n\nLanding - \nHot press and timber flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.0m x 3.55m\nLaminate floor, window to front, built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.20m x 3.55m\nLaminate floor, window to rear, built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 1.70m x 2.50m\ntiled floor, part tiled walls, bath, corner shower with glass screen, WC, wash hand basin, heated towel rail\n\nAttic room - 2.10m x 3.55m\nLaminate floor, double bed eaves storage, Velux\n\nStoreroom - 1.80m x 3.55m\nlaminate floor, eaves storage\n\nGarden - \ngranite patio, stone wall, raised flowerbed, artificial lawn\n\n"
      },
